T* (“In Adobe Illustrator, the workspace consists of various tools and) Tj
T* (\(1\) **Layout** that help users create and edit) Tj
T* (graphics efficiently. Illustrator allows users to) Tj
T* (\(2\) **Switch** between different workspaces) Tj
