T* () Tj
T* (**Explanation of Corrections for Q7:**) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (*   **\(1\) Layout:** The term "Layout" refers to the arrangement of) Tj
T* (elements on the screen, which directly relates to how users create and) Tj
T* (edit graphics efficiently within a workspace.) Tj
T* (*   **\(2\) Switch:** The sentence discusses the ability to move between) Tj
T* (different workspaces, and "Switch" is the appropriate verb for this action.) Tj
T* (*   **\(3\) Preset:** "Preset" accurately describes workspaces that are) Tj
