T* (**08. Determine whether the statements below are True \(T\) or False \(F\):) Tj
T* (\(5 Marks\)**) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (a. The package.json file stores all installed dependencies in a Vue) Tj
T* (   project. **\(T\)**) Tj
T* (b. Vue.js is a backend framework. **\(F\)**) Tj
T* (c. The Vue Router package must be installed separately in Vue) Tj
